msgstr ""
"**[Jak działa fabric](concepts.md)** — model myślowy: mesh, tożsamość, "
"tematy, pub/sub i dlaczego nie ma brokera."

#: src/introduction.md:26
msgid ""
"**[Everyday tasks](everyday.md)** — the commands you'll reach for: publish, "
